      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "die_jaw",
      "narration": "While you're using your baby teeth, the permanent ones are already growing, hidden in the bone right underneath.",
      "on_screen_text": "The new ones wait below",
      "highlight_words": [
        "below"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "die_count",
      "narration": "Kids have twenty baby teeth, and adults can have up to thirty-two.",
      "on_screen_text": "From 20 to 32",
      "highlight_words": [
        "32"
      ],
      "sfx": "pop",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "die_roots",
      "narration": "As the new tooth pushes up, the body gradually dissolves the baby tooth's root.",
      "on_screen_text": "The root dissolves",
      "highlight_words": [
        "dissolves"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "die_push",
      "narration": "With no root to hold it, it gets loose and falls out, and the new one takes its place.",
      "on_screen_text": "Loose and out",
      "highlight_words": [
        "out"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "die_enamel",
      "narration": "Teeth are covered in enamel, the hardest substance in the whole body.",
      "on_screen_text": "Enamel: the hardest",
      "highlight_words": [
        "hardest"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "die_cavity",
      "narration": "But mouth bacteria eat sugar and make acid, which slowly opens holes: cavities.",
      "on_screen_text": "How cavities start",
      "highlight_words": [
        "cavities"
      ],
      "sfx": "bubbles",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "die_norepair",
      "narration": "And enamel doesn't grow back, so your permanent teeth have to last a lifetime.",
      "on_screen_text": "It doesn't grow back",
      "highlight_words": [
        "back"
      ],
      "sfx": "ding",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
